.TH PHX-DATALAKE 1 "2026-10-18" "Phalanx Duel" "Phalanx Duel Analytics"
.SH NAME
phx-datalake \- multi-repository engineering datalake for Phalanx Duel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B phx datalake
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B phx-datalake
operates the local DuckDB and Apache Parquet engineering datalake. It ingests
commit histories, file churn, tasks, ADRs, and dependencies across all repositories
in the phalanxduel GitHub organization into a 3-tier Medallion architecture
(Bronze JSONL -> Silver Parquet -> Gold DuckDB).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B build
Ingest multi-repo histories and compile Silver Parquet & Gold DuckDB views.
.TP
.B query <sql> [--json|--csv]
Execute an ad-hoc SQL query against the Gold analytical DuckDB database.
.TP
.B summary
Display top-level summary KPIs (total commits, authors, lines added/deleted).
.TP
.B tables
List all Silver Parquet tables and Gold analytical views.
.TP
.B report
Output the full automatically-generated markdown analytics report.
.TP
.B shell
Launch the interactive DuckDB terminal shell on phalanx_datalake.duckdb.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR phx (1),
.BR duckdb (1)
